---
layout: page.njk
title: "Partner with DevFest Berlin"
description: "Support Berlin's community-run developer festival on November 14, 2026, and meet the people who build with technology here."
permalink: /sponsors/
---
{% set sponsorship = site.sponsorship %}
{% set mailto = "mailto:" + sponsorship.email + "?subject=" + (sponsorship.emailSubject | urlencode) %}

<p>{{ sponsorship.pitch }}</p>
<p>
    DevFest Berlin is part of the worldwide DevFest season of the Google Developer Groups. It is organized by the
    local communities, not by Google, so partner support goes straight into the event.
</p>

<h2>{{ sponsorship.statsTitle }}</h2>
<ul class="sponsor-stats" role="list">
    {% for stat in sponsorship.stats %}
    <li><strong>{{ stat.value }}</strong> <span>{{ stat.label }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Who you will meet</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Engineers, designers and tech leads, from students to senior professionals</li>
    <li>Members of Berlin's developer communities, from Android and Flutter to Cloud, Go and Web</li>
    <li>Speakers and Google Developer Experts from the organizing communities</li>
</ul>

<h2>Where you can help</h2>
<div class="sponsor-needs">
    {% for need in sponsorship.needs %}
    <div class="sponsor-need">
        <span class="venue-badge">{{ need.priority }}</span>
        <h3>{{ need.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ need.text }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
<p>Have another idea, like hosting a workshop or covering speaker travel? We would love to hear it.</p>

<h2>What you get</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Meet developers who could be your next colleagues</li>
    <li>Show what makes your team and your product stand out</li>
    <li>Talk to experts who may help solve problems in your organization</li>
</ul>

{% if site.sponsors.length %}
<h2>Our partners</h2>
{% include "partials/sponsor-wall.njk" %}
{% endif %}

<div class="sponsor-cta">
    <h2>Let's talk</h2>
    <p>Write to us and we will send you our sponsorship deck and find a way to work together that fits you.</p>
    <a class="sponsor-button" href="{{ mailto }}">Email us</a>
    <p class="sponsor-email">{{ sponsorship.email }}</p>
</div>
